  "body": "## Reproduced and published; actual-merge closeout pending\n\nv16.50 asks whether the exact child interface used by v16.49 survives recursive binary joining. Independent analytical review accepts an induction for every finite full binary tree: fixed-root normalization with total L1 excursion at most1, compact endpoint contraction, and complete-role transport preserving all inner hitting coordinates. Leaf contraction and ordered-palette equivariance are explicit. Higher arity and arbitrary retained categories remain outside the theorem.\n\n- Verified integrated parent: `a8280c1c77d7e29f8b90dfd4807bede6411c7ca7`.\n- Prospective direct-child protocol: `19306397237d3b6941d5b3b463839337febce145`.\n- Genuine [RED run36874790244](https://github.com/proteinfoldingengine/WetLabEngine/actions/runs/36874790244): missing recursion and supplied-only omission failures observed before implementation; raw hash-bound archive retained.\n- Reviewed scientific source: `8e8be1622b4bb81cc1615a97c1d3ad4511e5dfeb`.\n- Frozen directed corpus:1920 exact specification identities on N=(fork,cherry) and D=(fork,fork), every binary target profile, minimal/spare palettes,3global permutations and compact/overlap-inflated starts. Independent verifier reconstructs complete identities, starts/endpoints, admission, moves and total excursion at every state.\n- Source review found and repaired a pivot-control coverage gap before execution: forced left/right same-child swaps now use the production transport helper, independently audit24primitive moves, and verify pivot restoration.\n- [Full science and fresh reproduction run36876471717](https://github.com/proteinfoldingengine/WetLabEngine/actions/runs/36876471717): ALL jobs SUCCESS; independent audit verified both archives and36identical scientific files, including fresh parent49/nested evidence. Full934 inherited checks plus60new controls (994total), fresh parent49/nested science.\n\nGeneral quantification rests on the composition proof, not a larger enumeration. Directed cases are not exhaustive state-space universes. Failed construction is INTERFACE_NOT_PRESERVED/INCOMPLETE evidence and does not establish a nonunit barrier; a nonunit claim requires a separately certified complete threshold cut plus admitted connecting path. Primary B1/Binf/Bs remain independently minimized scalar objectives; LEX remains separate. Scientific and publication byte audits passed:994exact checks,94execution manifest members,1777Git-bound source/input paths and235publication manifest entries. Results:1920valid cases,72512primitive moves,878unit-excursion paths,zero construction failures. Independent proof/source/artifact/publication reviews approved. Housekeeping-only publication repair removed3compiled caches and added an ignore rule; scientific sources and raw archives are unchanged. Full actual-merge replay and independently documented receipt closeout remain required before CLOSED/CERTIFIED.\n\nReviewed publication head: `8b6f929f14cd6ec1fcfc199eaa60dd5ddad1bcd4`; tree `9e80e59c31afef814d8de450d049e7fdbd561cd3`. Source run artifact digests: science `61c1a6f07d521eb7f80b21c4a71d59248e94939156ce77ed98725c64e991cce3`; fresh reproduction `1d42d26be2aaa96a6eff64547f79d84a54e17dff632e6dc597657e8356a3477e`.\n",
